==Battleground==
*1 [[Doge Dark]] (100%) spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Doge Dark]]s (100%) spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

